aw:MsA">A</ref> | <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:accusativus"><abbr>ac</abbr></ref>:</hi> ~an læt <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Abt">Abt</ref> 26; ~an dæg <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ordal">Ordal</ref> 5,2; ~an dæl <hi rend="italic">Drittel</hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 19,1 (-da<ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:sic"><abbr>!</abbr></ref> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:B">B</ref>). 27 (þryd- <ref type="lawCode" target="law:So">So</ref>). 47. 71. <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 23. 57 <ref type="lawCode" target="law:B">B</ref> (sceat [<hi rend="italic">das <ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:ursprunglich"><abbr>ursprüngl.</abbr></ref></hi>] <ref type="lawCode" target="law:E">E</ref>; gescead <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:aufRasur"><abbr>auf Rasur</abbr></ref></hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:H">H</ref>). <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEg">II Eg</ref> 2 = <ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 11. <ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 6 ‖ <hi rend="bold"><hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:femininum"><abbr>fm</abbr></ref>:</hi></hi> sio ~de þeowa <hi rend="italic">an Rang dritte</hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Abt">Abt</ref> 11 | <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Genitiv"><abbr>gn</abbr></ref>:</hi> þare ~an wuduwan <hi rend="italic">an Rang dr.</hi> 75,1 | <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Dativ"><abbr>dt</abbr></ref>:</hi> æt þare ~dan <hi rend="italic">an Rang dr.</hi> 16 | <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:accusativus"><abbr>ac</abbr></ref>:</hi> ~dde <ref type="lawCode" target="law:ECf">ECf</ref> 23,1; <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:Variante"><abbr>Var.</abbr></ref></hi> ~dde, thredde, ~ddem ‖ <hi rend="bold"><hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:neutrum"><abbr>nt</abbr></ref>:</hi></hi> ~dde is <hi re